    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβάσκαντος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>secure against enchantments,
				free from harm</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				5053
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5119
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Nubia</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				7.234
			</span></i>; esp. of children, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				8.11
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				300
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>:— in act. sense, <i>acting as a
				charm</i> or <i>protection against witchcraft,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀνθρώποις καὶ ζῴοις</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.01
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ὑγιαίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					292
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.267
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not harming,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Leid.W.
				18.7
			</span></i>.</div>
